  "prefLabel": "Plc 1408.01 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1408.01 Applicability.\n\n(a) The standards in this part shall apply to each individual who applies to be licensed under RSA 326-J or who is licensed under RSA 326-J.\n\n(b) Violations of these standards shall constitute unprofessional conduct that subjects the violator to disciplinary proceedings pursuant to Plc 1409.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1400) #13705, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14442, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES 1-26-36",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1400.html"
